The  command  displays  or sets various variables that affect the
radio tuner behavior. If a variable is  present  on  the  command
line, prints the current value of this variable for the specified
device.   By default, operates on the device.  The options are as
follows: Print all device variables  and  their  current  values.
Attempt  to  set the specified variable to Specify an alternative
radio tuner device.  Suppress  printing  of  the  variable  name.
